Scope
-----
Everything inside this folder (references/codeql/): SKILL.md, workflows/,
references/ and scripts/ (including the tests), is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
This folder is NOT covered by the repository's MIT license.

Kio's own review process (two-stage review, 5-layer checklist, sign-off) lives
outside this folder, in ../security-review.md, and stays under the MIT license.

