Changes by Kio System (indicated as required by CC BY-SA 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B))
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files were imported, edited and reorganised by Kio System; the exact edits of each
file are in this repository's git history (path skills/kio-qa-security/references/codeql/).
Known changes:
- Moved into kio-qa-security/references/codeql/ and re-linked to Kio's folder layout.
- SKILL.md rewritten as a Semgrep/CodeQL entry point (database discovery, "each Bash
  call is a fresh shell" note, Semgrep quick start); the review process was moved to
  ../security-review.md.
- Frontmatter reduced to name, description and metadata.
- Semgrep invoked with --metrics=off in the quick start.
- Scripts and tests kept; three tests that need the upstream file
  workflows/codeql-build.js (not included) are skipped with a reason.

